<title>JAPAN: Nikko Sec says loss on securities 25.40 bln yen.</title>
<headline>Nikko Sec says loss on securities 25.40 bln yen.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nikko Securities Co Ltd said on Tuesday that its appraisal losses on securities holdings totalled 25.40 billion yen at the end of the business year to March 31, 1997.</p>
</text>
